      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/pace_mississippi",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pace sits in the fertile Delta, about 12 miles east of the Mississippi River, where alluvial soils fuel intensive farming.",
